messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 978 and 435?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 978 and 435, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm. Here are the key steps:.\n\n1. **Multiply 978 by 5 (units place of 435):**.\n   \\[.\n   978 \\times 5 = 4890.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 978 by 30 (tens place of 435, shifted one position left):**.\n   \\[.\n   978 \\times 3 = 2934 \\quad \\text{(then shifted left by one digit)} \\quad 29340.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 978 by 400 (hundreds place of 435, shifted two positions left):**.\n   \\[.\n   978 \\times 4 = 3912 \\quad \\text{(then shifted left by two digits)} \\quad 391200.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**.\n   \\[.\n   4890 + 29340 + 391200.\n   \\].\n\n   - First, add \\(4890\\) and \\(29340\\):.\n     \\[.\n     4890 + 29340 = 34230.\n     \\].\n   - Then add the result to \\(391200\\):.\n     \\[.\n     34230 + 391200 = 425430.\n     \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
