messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 760 and 998?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 760 and 998, we can use the distributive property by recognizing that 998 is close to 1000. .\n\nFirst, rewrite 998 as \\(1000 - 2\\):.\n\\[.\n760 \\times 998 = 760 \\times (1000 - 2).\n\\].\n\nApply the distributive property:.\n\\[.\n760 \\times 1000 - 760 \\times 2.\n\\].\n\nCalculate each part separately:.\n\\[.\n760 \\times 1000 = 760000.\n\\].\n\\[.\n760 \\times 2 = 1520.\n\\].\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:.\n\\[.\n760000 - 1520 = 758480.\n\\].\n\nVerification using the standard multiplication method:.\n- Multiply 760 by 8: \\(760 \\times 8 = 6080\\).\n- Multiply 760 by 90: \\(760 \\times 90 = 68400\\).\n- Multiply 760 by 900: \\(760 \\times 900 = 684000\\).\n\nAdd the results:.\n\\[.\n6080 + 68400 + 684000 = 758480.\n\\].\n\nBoth methods confirm the result. Therefore, the answer is ']]
