messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 403 and 616?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 403 and 616, we can use the distributive property and the standard multiplication algorithm.\n\nFirst, using the distributive property:.\n\\[.\n(400 + 3)(600 + 16).\n\\].\nExpanding this, we get four terms:.\n\\[.\n400 \\times 600 + 400 \\times 16 + 3 \\times 600 + 3 \\times 16.\n\\].\nCalculating each term:.\n\\[.\n400 \\times 600 = 240000.\n\\].\n\\[.\n400 \\times 16 = 6400.\n\\].\n\\[.\n3 \\times 600 = 1800.\n\\].\n\\[.\n3 \\times 16 = 48.\n\\].\nAdding these results together:.\n\\[.\n240000 + 6400 + 1800 + 48 = 248248.\n\\].\n\nNext, using the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n    403 \\\\.\n  \\times 616 \\\\.\n  \\hline.\n    2418 \\quad (\\text{403} \\times 6) \\\\.\n   4030 \\quad \\ (\\text{403} \\times 10) \\\\.\n 241800 \\quad \\ (\\text{403} \\times 600) \\\\.\n  \\hline.\n  248248 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\nAdding the results of the partial products:.\n\\[. Therefore, the answer is ']]
