messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 828 and 612?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 828 and 612, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n1. **Multiply 828 by 2 (units place of 612):**.\n   \\[.\n   828 \\times 2 = 1656.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 828 by 1 (tens place of 612), shifted one position to the left:**.\n   \\[.\n   828 \\times 1 = 828 \\quad \\text{(shifted becomes 8280)}.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 828 by 6 (hundreds place of 612), shifted two positions to the left:**.\n   \\[.\n   828 \\times 6 = 4968 \\quad \\text{(shifted becomes 496800)}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add all the partial products:**.\n   \\[.\n   1656 + 8280 + 496800.\n   \\].\n\n   - First, add \\(1656 + 8280\\):.\n     \\[.\n     1656 + 8280 = 9936.\n     \\].\n\n   - Then add the result to \\(496800\\):.\n     \\[.\n     9936 + 496800 = 506736.\n     \\].\n\nVerification using different methods (breaking down numbers and reordering multiplication) confirms the result. Therefore, the answer is ']]
