messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 858 and 624?', '.\n\nThe product of 858 and 624 is calculated as follows:.\n\n1. **Breakdown using the standard multiplication algorithm:**.\n   - Multiply 858 by 4 (units place of 624):.\n     ```.\n      858.\n    ×   4.\n    ─────.\n     3432.\n     ```.\n   - Multiply 858 by 20 (tens place of 624, shifted left by 1):.\n     ```.\n      858.\n    ×  20.\n    ─────.\n    17160.\n     ```.\n   - Multiply 858 by 600 (hundreds place of 624, shifted left by 2):.\n     ```.\n      858.\n    × 600.\n    ─────.\n    514800.\n     ```.\n\n2. **Sum the partial products:**.\n   ```.\n     3432.\n   +17160.\n   +514800.\n   ───────.\n    535392.\n   ```.\n\n3. **Verification using distributive property:**.\n   - \\( 858 \\times 624 = 858 \\times (600 + 24) \\).\n   - \\( = (858 \\times 600) + (858 \\times 24) \\).\n   - \\( = 514,\\!800 + 20,\\!592 = 535,\\!392 \\).\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is ']]
