messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 968 and 729?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 968 and 729, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm by breaking it down into partial products and then summing them up.\n\n1. **Multiply 968 by 9 (the ones place of 729):**.\n   \\[.\n   968 \\times 9 = 8712.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 968 by 20 (the tens place of 729):**.\n   \\[.\n   968 \\times 20 = 19360.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 968 by 700 (the hundreds place of 729):**.\n   \\[.\n   968 \\times 700 = 677600.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Sum the partial products:**.\n   \\[.\n   8712 + 19360 + 677600.\n   \\].\n\n   - Adding the first two partial products:.\n     \\[.\n     8712 + 19360 = 28072.\n     \\].\n   - Adding the result to the third partial product:.\n     \\[.\n     28072 + 677600 = 705672.\n     \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
