messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 455 and 201?', '.\n\nThe product of 455 and 201 can be calculated using the distributive property:.\n\n\\[.\n455 \\times 201 = 455 \\times (200 + 1) = (455 \\times 200) + (455 \\times 1).\n\\].\n\nBreaking it down:.\n- \\( 455 \\times 200 = 91,000 \\).\n- \\( 455 \\times 1 = 455 \\).\n\nAdding these results:.\n\\[.\n91,000 + 455 = 91,455.\n\\].\n\nVerification through multiple methods (standard algorithm, prime factorization, and alternative decompositions) confirms the result. Therefore, the answer is ']]
