messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 337 and 514?', '.\n\nThe product of 337 and 514 is calculated as follows:.\n\n1. **Multiply 337 by 4 (units place of 514):**.\n   \\[.\n   337 \\times 4 = 1,\\!348.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 337 by 10 (tens place of 514):**.\n   \\[.\n   337 \\times 10 = 3,\\!370.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 337 by 500 (hundreds place of 514):**.\n   \\[.\n   337 \\times 500 = 168,\\!500.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add all partial products together:**.\n   \\[.\n   1,\\!348 + 3,\\!370 + 168,\\!500 = 173,\\!218.\n   \\].\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is ']]
