messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 348 and 861?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 348 and 861, we use the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n1. **Multiply 348 by 1 (units place of 861):**.\n   \\[.\n   348 \\times 1 = 348.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 348 by 6 (tens place of 861, shifted one position left):**.\n   \\[.\n   348 \\times 6 = 2088 \\quad \\text{(shifted left by one digit gives 20880)}.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 348 by 8 (hundreds place of 861, shifted two positions left):**.\n   \\[.\n   348 \\times 8 = 2784 \\quad \\text{(shifted left by two digits gives 278400)}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add the partial products:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{r}.\n      \\quad 348 \\\\.\n     +20880 \\\\.\n   +278400 \\\\.\n   \\hline.\n     299628 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\].\n\nVerification using the distributive property:.\n\\[.\n348 \\times 861 = 348 \\times (800 + 60 + 1) = (348 \\times 800) + (348 \\times 60) + (348 \\times 1).\n\\].\n\\[.\n348 \\times 800 = 278400, \\quad 348 \\times 60 = 20880, \\quad 348 \\times 1 = 348.\n\\].\n\\[. Therefore, the answer is ']]
