messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 487 and 305?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 487 and 305, we can use the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n1. **Multiply 487 by 5 (units place of 305):**.\n   \\[.\n   487 \\times 5 = 2435.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 487 by 0 (tens place of 305):**.\n   \\[.\n   487 \\times 0 = 0 \\quad \\text{(shifted one position to the left, resulting in 0000)}.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 487 by 3 (hundreds place of 305, which is equivalent to multiplying by 300):**.\n   \\[.\n   487 \\times 3 = 1461 \\quad \\text{(shifted two positions to the left, resulting in 146100)}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add the partial products together:**.\n   \\[.\n   2435 + 0 + 146100 = 148535.\n   \\].\n\nVerification using the distributive property:.\n- Break down 305 into 300 and 5:.\n  \\[.\n  487 \\times 305 = 487 \\times (300 + 5) = 487 \\times 300 + 487 \\times 5.\n  \\].\n  \\[.\n  487 \\times 300 = 146100 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 487 \\times 5 = 2435.\n  \\].\n  \\[. Therefore, the answer is ']]
