messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 952 and 365?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 952 and 365, we can break down the multiplication using the standard algorithm:.\n\n1. **Multiply 952 by 5 (units place):**.\n   \\[.\n   952 \\times 5 = 4760.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 952 by 6 (tens place) and shift one position to the left:**.\n   \\[.\n   952 \\times 6 = 5712 \\quad \\text{(then shift left by one, resulting in 57120)}.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 952 by 3 (hundreds place) and shift two positions to the left:**.\n   \\[.\n   952 \\times 3 = 2856 \\quad \\text{(then shift left by two, resulting in 285600)}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add the results of the three multiplications:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{array}{r}.\n     4760 \\\\.\n    +57120 \\\\.\n    +285600 \\\\.\n    \\hline.\n     347480 \\\\.\n   \\end{array}.\n   \\].\n\n   - Adding 4760 and 57120:.\n     \\[.\n     4760 + 57120 = 61880.\n     \\].\n   - Adding the result to 285600:.\n     \\[.\n     61880 + 285600 = 347480.\n     \\].\n\n5. **Verification using division:**.\n   \\[. Therefore, the answer is ']]
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-a79889ed53ed40d4a198bb1722a9d86a",
