messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 790 and 198?', '.\n\nThe product of 790 and 198 is calculated as follows:.\n\nFirst, decompose 198 into \\(200 - 2\\):.\n\\[.\n790 \\times 198 = 790 \\times (200 - 2).\n\\].\n\nApply the distributive property:.\n\\[.\n= 790 \\times 200 - 790 \\times 2.\n\\].\n\nCalculate each term separately:.\n\\[.\n790 \\times 200 = 158,\\!000 \\quad \\text{(since \\(790 \\times 2 = 1,\\!580\\) and \\(1,\\!580 \\times 100 = 158,\\!000\\))}.\n\\].\n\\[.\n790 \\times 2 = 1,\\!580.\n\\].\n\nSubtract the second result from the first:.\n\\[.\n158,\\!000 - 1,\\!580 = 156,\\!420.\n\\].\n\n**Verification via direct multiplication:**.\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n      790 \\\\.\n\\times 198 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n      6,\\!320 \\quad (\\text{790 × 8}) \\\\.\n    71,\\!100 \\quad (\\text{790 × 90, shifted left by 1}) \\\\.\n+ 79,\\!000 \\quad (\\text{790 × 100, shifted left by 2}) \\\\.\n\\hline.\n    156,\\!420 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is ']]
