messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 621 and 138?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 621 and 138, we use the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n1. **Multiply 621 by 8 (units place of 138):**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{align}.\n   621 \\times 8 &= 4968 \\\\.\n   \\end{align}.\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 621 by 30 (tens place of 138):**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{align}.\n   621 \\times 3 &= 1863 \\\\.\n   1863 \\times 10 &= 18630 \\\\.\n   \\end{align}.\n   \\].\n\n3. **Multiply 621 by 100 (hundreds place of 138):**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{align}.\n   621 \\times 1 &= 621 \\\\.\n   621 \\times 100 &= 62100 \\\\.\n   \\end{align}.\n   \\].\n\n4. **Add all the partial products together:**.\n   \\[.\n   \\begin{align}.\n   4968 + 18630 + 62100 &= 4968 + 18630 + 62100 \\\\.\n   &= 23598 + 62100 \\\\.\n   &= 85698 \\\\.\n   \\end{align}.\n   \\]. Therefore, the answer is ']]
