messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 216 and 398?', '.\n\nThe product of 216 and 398 is calculated as follows:.\n\n**Step 1:** Break down 398 into 400 - 2 for easier computation.  .\n**Step 2:** Use the distributive property:  .\n\\[.\n216 \\times 398 = 216 \\times (400 - 2) = (216 \\times 400) - (216 \\times 2).\n\\].\n\n**Step 3:** Calculate each part:  .\n- \\(216 \\times 400 = 86,\\!400\\)  .\n- \\(216 \\times 2 = 432\\).\n\n**Step 4:** Subtract the results:  .\n\\[.\n86,\\!400 - 432 = 85,\\!968.\n\\].\n\n**Verification via Standard Algorithm:**  .\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n     216 \\\\.\n\\times 398 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n    1728 \\quad (\\text{216 × 8}) \\\\.\n  19440 \\quad (\\text{216 × 90}) \\\\.\n+64,\\!800 \\quad (\\text{216 × 300}) \\\\.\n\\hline.\n  85,\\!968 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n**Additional Checks:**  .\n- **Digital Roots:** Confirm the digital root of the product matches.  .\n- **Modulo 9 and 11:** Verify congruency with modular arithmetic.  .\n\n**Final Answer:**. Therefore, the answer is ']]
