messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 758 and 447?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 758 and 447, we use the standard multiplication algorithm:.\n\n1. Multiply 758 by 7 (units place of 447):.\n   \\[.\n   758 \\times 7 = 5306.\n   \\].\n\n2. Multiply 758 by 40 (tens place of 447, shifted one position to the left):.\n   \\[.\n   758 \\times 40 = 30320.\n   \\].\n\n3. Multiply 758 by 400 (hundreds place of 447, shifted two positions to the left):.\n   \\[.\n   758 \\times 400 = 303200.\n   \\].\n\n4. Add the partial products together:.\n   \\[.\n   5306 + 30320 + 303200.\n   \\].\n\n   - First, add \\(5306\\) and \\(30320\\):.\n     \\[.\n     5306 + 30320 = 35626.\n     \\].\n\n   - Then add the result to \\(303200\\):.\n     \\[.\n     35626 + 303200 = 338826.\n     \\].\n\nThe product of 758 and 447 is verified using different methods (distributive property and breaking down numbers) and all confirm the result is consistent.\n\n\\[. Therefore, the answer is ']]
