messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 596 and 932?', '.\n\nThe product of 596 and 932 is calculated as follows:.\n\n1. **Break down the multiplication using the standard algorithm:**.\n   - Multiply 596 by 2 (units place of 932):.\n     ```.\n     596 × 2 = 1,192.\n     ```.\n   - Multiply 596 by 30 (tens place of 932, shifted one position left):.\n     ```.\n     596 × 30 = 17,880.\n     ```.\n   - Multiply 596 by 900 (hundreds place of 932, shifted two positions left):.\n     ```.\n     596 × 900 = 536,400.\n     ```.\n\n2. **Sum the partial products:**.\n   ```.\n   1,192 (from 2×).\n   +17,880 (from 30×).\n   +536,400 (from 900×).\n   ---------------.\n   = 555,472.\n   ```. Therefore, the answer is ']]
