messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 479 and 601?', '.\n\nTo find the product of 479 and 601, we can use the difference of squares formula. .\n\nFirst, we note that 479 and 601 are equidistant from 540:.\n- \\( 601 - 540 = 61 \\).\n- \\( 540 - 479 = 61 \\).\n\nThus, we can express the numbers as:.\n- \\( 479 = 540 - 61 \\).\n- \\( 601 = 540 + 61 \\).\n\nUsing the difference of squares formula \\((a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2\\), we get:.\n\\[.\n(540 + 61)(540 - 61) = 540^2 - 61^2.\n\\].\n\nCalculating each term:.\n- \\( 540^2 = (54 \\times 10)^2 = 54^2 \\times 100 = 2916 \\times 100 = 291600 \\).\n- \\( 61^2 = (60 + 1)^2 = 60^2 + 2 \\times 60 \\times 1 + 1^2 = 3600 + 120 + 1 = 3721 \\).\n\nSubtracting these results:.\n\\[.\n291600 - 3721 = 287879.\n\\].\n\nVerification using direct multiplication:.\n- \\( 479 \\times 601 = 479 \\times (600 + 1) = 479 \\times 600 + 479 \\times 1 \\).\n- \\( 479 \\times 600 = 287400 \\).\n- \\( 479 \\times 1 = 479 \\). Therefore, the answer is ']]
