messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 846 and 105?', '.\n\nThe product of 846 and 105 can be calculated using the distributive property:.\n\n1. **Break down 105 into 100 + 5**:.\n   \\[.\n   846 \\times 105 = 846 \\times (100 + 5).\n   \\].\n\n2. **Multiply 846 by each part**:.\n   - \\( 846 \\times 100 = 84,\\!600 \\).\n   - \\( 846 \\times 5 = 4,\\!230 \\).\n\n3. **Add the results**:.\n   \\[.\n   84,\\!600 + 4,\\!230 = 88,\\!830.\n   \\].\n\n**Verification**:.\n- Using standard multiplication:.\n  \\[.\n  \\begin{array}{r}.\n      846 \\\\.\n    \\times 105 \\\\.\n    \\hline.\n      4,\\!230 \\quad (\\text{846 × 5}) \\\\.\n    + 84,\\!600 \\quad (\\text{846 × 100, shifted two places}) \\\\.\n    \\hline.\n      88,\\!830 \\\\.\n  \\end{array}.\n  \\].\n\n**Final Answer**:. Therefore, the answer is ']]
