ge\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of 353 and 358 is \\boxed{126374}.<\uff5c/Message\uff5c>\n\nThe product of",
